{"word":"φράζω","uri":"phrazô","senses":[{"word":"φράζω","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">φράζω</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">f.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">-άσω</span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾰ</span>] <span class=\"ital\">ao.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἔφρασα</span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾰσ</span>] <span class=\"ital\">pf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πέφρακα</span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾰκ</span>])\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">primit.</span> mettre dans l’esprit, <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> faire comprendre, expliquer, indiquer par signe\naussi bien que par la parole : <span class=\"grec\">σήματα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">19, 250,</span> indiquer par la parole des signes, des\nmarques (qui montrent qu’on a vu la personne dont on parle) ;\n<span class=\"grec\">διὰ γραμμάτων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pomp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">45,</span> faire comprendre <span class=\"ital\">ou</span>\nexpliquer par des lettres ; <span class=\"grec\">διὰ μαντικῆς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mem.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 4, 15,</span> faire comprendre par la\ndivination ; <span class=\"grec\">τῇ χειρί,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 113,</span> faire\ncomprendre par des signes de la main ; <span class=\"grec\">τὴν\nἀτραπόν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 213,</span> indiquer le chemin ; <span class=\"grec\">μῦθον πᾶσιν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 273,</span> expliquer clairement à tous ce\nqu’on veut dire ; <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">φημί,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.R.</span> <span class=\"refch\">655 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">à</span> <span class=\"grec\">λέγω</span> : <span class=\"grec\">φρ